ana Janković was the same age as Maja when her own family left Ivangrad (today Berane) for the European north, and that is only the most superficial similarity between the two. As two of her leading men, fellow Ivangradian Dejan Čukić and Osijek’s one and only Zlatko Burić, will surely know, the details of Maja’s or Marijana’s story may be specific, but the larger flow of things has remained the same across generations and countries of origin.","vod_play_from":"bfzym3u8","vod_play_server":"","vod_play_note":"","vod_play_url":"HD$https:\/\/fengbao12.com\/video\/jia2026\/a2855956d5e1\/index.m3u8","vod_down_from":"","vod_down_server":"","vod_down_note":"","vod_down_url":"","vod_plot":0,"vod_plot_name":"","vod_plot_detail":"","type_name":"剧情片"},{"vod_id":159933,"type_id":26,"type_id_1":20,"group_id":0,"vod_name":"恶魔契约","vod_sub":"","vod_en":"emoqiyue","vod_status":1,"vod_letter":"E","vod_color":"","vod_tag":"","vod_class":"剧情","vod_pic":"https:\/\/img.picbf.com\/upload\/vod\/20260827-1\/90adf6aba10903d1d7b5e3c85b041b59.jpg","vod_pic_thumb":"","vod_pic_slide":"","vod_pic_screenshot":"","vod_actor":"Callista Arum,Kenny Austin,Gemi Nastiti","vod_director":"Farid Dermawan","vod_writer":"","vod_behind":"","vod_blurb":"卡尔蒂尼违抗父母，前往雅加达追逐奖学金梦想。她找到一间规矩怪异的廉价女子宿舍，却不知此地暗藏黑暗秘密 —— 她将成为邪恶仪式的下一个祭品。","vod_remarks":"更新至HD","vod_pubdate":"2024(印度尼西亚)","vod_total":0,"vod_serial":"0","vod_tv":"","vod_weekday":"","vod_area":"印度尼西亚","vod_lang":"印尼语","vod_year":"2024","vod_version":"","vod_state":"","vod_author":"","vod_jumpurl":"","vod_tpl":"","vod_tpl_play":"","vod_tpl_down":"","vod_isend":0,"vod_lock":0,"vod_level":0,"vod_copyright":0,"vod_points":0,"vod_points_play":0,"vod_points_down":0,"vod_hits":171,"vod_hits_day":466,"vod_hits_week":910,"vod_hits_month":558,"vod_duration":"75分钟","vod_up":748,"vod_down":212,"vod_score":"3.0","vod_score_all":1074,"vod_score_num":358,"vod_time":"2026-08-27 09:55:23","vod_time_add":1787795719,"vod_time_hits":0,"vod_time_make":0,"vod_trysee":0,"vod_douban_id